            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kyonthe kĩla Samueli ũla mwoni, na Saulo mwana wa Kisu, na Avineli mwana wa Neli, na Yoavu mwana wa Nzeluia maĩ manavathie kĩthĩwe kĩtheu, o ũla wavathie kĩndũ o na kĩva kĩthĩwe kĩtheu, kyaĩ ũsũvĩonĩ Selemothi, na wa ana‐a‐ĩthe make.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
